lways in your pocket\n\n■ Thoughts and Ideas: never lose important ideas amidst multiple notes\n\n■ Photos: add photos that made your day\n\n■ Calendar: beautiful background images for every season\n\n■ Countdown timer: see how much's left till the end of day, month, week, year and \"life\". This feature is optional and can be switched off in app settings\n\n■ LifeViewer - Daily Planner will help you be more productive!\n\n■ Your feedback matters, please email us at: acydapp@gmail.com\n\nJoin our community on Twitter, Reddit, Telegram, Fb. Please find links in app settings at the bottom of the screen\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.termsfeed.com/terms-conditions/569862d2409e5ea352012edb31756c16","released":"2019-10-10","updated":"2024-09-16","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/28/f2/58/28f25868-2729-4007-ca29-823f32341508/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/28/f2/58/28f25868-2729-4007-ca29-823f32341508/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-7-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Productivity","rating":4.4,"ratings":119,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":1,"hn_comments":2,"submissions":1,"self_n":1,"hn_score":2.58,"first":1580857916,"last":1580857916,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":0,"pos_pct":null,"neg_pct":null,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":22242170,"k":"ios:1482922018","type":"story","by":"victor_khodalov","time":1580857916,"text":"","title":"App shows how much time you've got left in life","story_id":22242170,"story_title":"App shows how much time you've got left in life","story_score":1,"comments":2,"w":2.585,"u":-1,"s":"pos","self":true}],"slug":"daily-planner-schedule-app"}